project Name : High-Availability Containerized Microservices Infrastructure
Tools: 
Amazon EKS, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, SonarQube (SAST), Terraform, AWS(VPC,EC2,IAM,Security Groups)
Docker, Git, GitHub, Python 3.11-slim, Prometheus, Grafana
overview : 
• Architected and deployed containerized Python microservices on an Amazon EKS cluster within a secure AWS VPC.
• Managed multi-subnet AWS infrastructure to ensure high availabilty using Terraform for repeatable provisioning.
• Engineered automated GitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines for build, test, quality checks, and production deployment.
• Integrated SonarQube quality gates to enforce code quality and application security.
• Utilized Prometheus and Grafana observability frameworks to build real-time monitoring infrastructure, capturing
system health and establishing proactive alerting loops for application reliability

